                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\">Quiz Check-In</text>\n<circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"470\" r=\"260\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\">How should you treat</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\">the donkey-joke</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\">death story?</text>\n</svg>",
                    "caption": "Testing the historiographical skill of handling conflicting ancient anecdotes."
